<title>USA: TABLE - Selfcare Q2 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Selfcare Q2 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.71   profit	 $0.44</p>
<p> Net	  loss	  5,834   profit	 2,707</p>
<p> EBITDA     loss	  2,178     loss	 1,925</p>
<p> Rev			 12,676		    2,828</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,234		    6,170</p>
<p>Six months</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $1.45     loss	 $2.22</p>
<p> Net	  loss	 10,728     loss	13,610</p>
<p> EBITDA     loss	  5,158     loss	 4,231</p>
<p> Revs			21,771		    5,298</p>
<p> Avg			  7,417		    6,143</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Selfcare Inc had about $5 million in special gains in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
